[{"client_msg_id":"764b2707-06fc-4aef-8ad6-251e72b51b3e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/streamich/react-use/pull/2101\u003e\nこれがブロックしてて TS4.4.2 にあげられない :gunnyari:","ts":"1630760711.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e332ab0-d7ee-492c-913d-4b2cc31f94b1","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"react-useのuseLocalStorageだとglobal state的な使い方ができなくて、試行錯誤した結果変なhooksを生み出してしまった。\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/johejo/5c8835c7b0a628a9be4361e43e231919|https://gist.github.com/johejo/5c8835c7b0a628a9be4361e43e231919\u003e","ts":"1630760538.141900","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1630761130.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TqeY"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U029LGDM3M5","text":"\u003c@U029LGDM3M5\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630758780.139800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b4b88bce-61aa-4344-8843-89645f38d929","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれ?、JS/TS関係で勘違いしてるのかな、おさわがせしあした...","ts":"1630745730.138400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ytKI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48b93dca-8a3e-49ab-9000-915f588cba71","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"付属してない、とは。  `new Uint8Array().byteLength` は存在するプロパティですが。","ts":"1630744811.137900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EbjQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd6c393d-02d1-4c94-8659-450d9706900e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあそうなんですけど、そもそも付属してない関数(メソッド)つないでよく動いてるな...と","ts":"1630744692.136600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ER"}]},{"client_msg_id":"194650af-d7f7-48da-bd67-c2fcea1100db","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Uint8Array は TypedArray (JS名前空間には無い) にプロトタイプチェーンしてるので *Own* ではないので取得できない。\n力技というか仕様通りですね。","ts":"1630744517.136000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L9C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f771354f-fd44-4542-85be-396a29145c19","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんか力技になっちゃうのね","ts":"1630741430.130000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ITD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4bdf92c-d5c8-48de-8d95-9c174e3127fc","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"TypedArray を無理やり取得","ts":"1630741374.129700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qQLrE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b35e65aa-32fc-45c9-804e-f05c8e6f2f5c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"はあなるほど…","ts":"1630741323.129400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Se+c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81b4671e-e990-4476-a1d4-7b8902252625","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"```const buffer = new Uint8Array(8);\n\nconst byteLength = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(Object.getPrototypeOf(Uint8Array).prototype, \"byteLength\").get;\nconst bytes = byteLength.bind(buffer)();\n\nconsole.log(bytes);\n// expected output: 8```","ts":"1630741320.129200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7YDjS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1f0f447-37c7-4450-baf1-9bc7af6959b2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"```console.log(Object.getOwnPropertyNames(Uint8Array.prototype));\n// Array [\"constructor\", \"BYTES_PER_ELEMENT\"]```","ts":"1630740742.128100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tlmIA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98c464d7-babb-4fcc-a1d3-8d40e9ff0bc5","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Uint8Array だとうまくいかない","ts":"1630740352.127700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fgT7n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"927b0c05-075b-48c6-8805-28b2981203f3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"```const buffer = new ArrayBuffer(8);\n\nconst byteLength = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(ArrayBuffer.prototype, \"byteLength\").get;\nconst bytes = byteLength.bind(buffer)();\n\nconsole.log(bytes);\n// expected output: 8```","ts":"1630738950.126800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C+70"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc08245b-3371-409e-b7f6-4f52e5479d94","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"でできました","ts":"1630738854.124800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U9Ra"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1c2fab3-cf7b-4f8e-8901-b787fa05146c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(ArrayBuffer.prototype, \"byteLength\").get`","ts":"1630738851.124600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RKAMv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88b22d4a-9bcc-49f4-8419-dd26506b9aa7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor?","ts":"1630738484.124200","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1630738494.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4vTmY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cc85949-fdbd-4b16-a275-d77bedf28092","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"getter (ArrayBuffer の byteLength) を関数として取得するのってどうやるんですっけ?","ts":"1630738465.123900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5+/u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7D22F867-D716-4C0A-8EC5-3C9E96A69E6A","